### =====================================================================
### JURIKA — Smoke tests Sprint 2 (Observabilite + Audit)
###
### Pre-requis Java :
###   - Stack applicative demarree
###   - Compte demo : JUR-DEMO1 / admin@jurika.ma / Admin@2026 (SUPER_ADMIN)
###
### Pre-requis stack monitoring (etapes 7-8) :
###   $env:PROMETHEUS_OPS_PASSWORD = "..."
###   docker compose -f infrastructure/docker-compose.yml \
###                  -f infrastructure/monitoring/docker-compose.monitoring.yml up -d
### Sans monitoring, etapes 7-8 sont SKIPPABLES (Loki + Tempo).
### =====================================================================

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@auth    = http://localhost:8081
@prometheus = http://localhost:9090
@grafana = http://localhost:3001
@loki = http://localhost:3100
@tempo = http://localhost:3200
@opsPassword = changeme-only-for-dev

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Login + verifier X-Correlation-Id propage en reponse
###    (TASK 1 — correlation ID HTTP)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name login
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: smoke-test-{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}

{
  "workspaceCode": "JUR-DEMO1",
  "email": "admin@jurika.ma",
  "password": "Admin@2026"
}

###
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.tokens.accessToken}}
### Attendu : status 200 + header X-Correlation-Id echo back

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. /actuator/health/readiness — K8s probe
###    (TASK 7 — health checks)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{auth}}/actuator/health/readiness
### Attendu : status 200 + body {"status":"UP","groups":[...]}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. /actuator/health/liveness — pas d'auth requise
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{auth}}/actuator/health/liveness
### Attendu : status 200 + body {"status":"UP"}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. /actuator/prometheus avec basic auth ops
###    (TASK 2 — Micrometer + OPS security)
###    Sans password configure, retourne 200 sans auth (dev local OK).
###    Avec password : 401 sans Authorization, 200 avec.
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{auth}}/actuator/prometheus
Authorization: Basic {{$base64 ops:{{opsPassword}}}}
### Attendu : status 200 + body text format Prometheus contenant :
###   - http_server_requests_seconds_count{application="auth-service",...}
###   - jvm_memory_used_bytes{application="auth-service",...}
###   - jurika_auth_login_success_total (apres l'etape 1)

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. Verifier compteur business apres login
###    (TASK 2 — BusinessMetrics jurika.auth.login.success)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{auth}}/actuator/prometheus
Authorization: Basic {{$base64 ops:{{opsPassword}}}}
### Filtrer : grep "jurika_auth_login" dans la reponse
### Attendu : jurika_auth_login_success_total >= 1

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. /api/v1/admin/audit — endpoint admin avec RLS bypass
###    (TASK 6 — audit log universel + admin endpoint)
###    Requiert ROLE_SUPER_ADMIN.
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/audit?action=LOGIN_SUCCESS&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### Attendu : status 200, items[] non vide, contient le login de l'etape 1
### avec correlationId, sourceService=auth-service, workspaceId, userId

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. Verifier presence du log dans Loki (PRE-REQUIS: stack monitoring up)
###    (TASK 4 — Loki + Promtail)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{loki}}/loki/api/v1/query_range?query={service="auth-service"}|json|correlationId!=""&limit=5
### Attendu : status 200, streams[] contient au moins une entree avec
### "correlationId":"smoke-test-..." du POST /login etape 1
### Si Loki pas demarre : SKIP cette etape.

### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. Verifier trace OTel dans Tempo (PRE-REQUIS: stack monitoring up)
###    (TASK 3 — OpenTelemetry + Tempo)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{tempo}}/api/search?tags=service.name%3Dauth-service&limit=5
### Attendu : status 200, traces[] contient des spans recents
### Avec service.name=auth-service. Cliquer sur une trace dans Grafana
### Explore -> Tempo doit montrer le span gateway -> auth-service -> postgresql.
### Si Tempo pas demarre : SKIP cette etape.

### =====================================================================
### Script PowerShell pour valider tout en un coup :
###
###   # Etape 1 (correlationId echo)
###   $login = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri "http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login" `
###     -Method POST -ContentType "application/json" `
###     -Headers @{"X-Correlation-Id"="smoke-ps-test"} `
###     -Body '{"workspaceCode":"JUR-DEMO1","email":"admin@jurika.ma","password":"Admin@2026"}'
###   $token = $login.tokens.accessToken
###
###   # Etape 4 (prometheus)
###   $opsAuth = "Basic " + [Convert]::ToBase64String([Text.Encoding]::UTF8.GetBytes("ops:changeme-only-for-dev"))
###   $prom = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri "http://localhost:8081/actuator/prometheus" `
###     -Headers @{"Authorization"=$opsAuth}
###   $prom | Select-String "jurika_auth_login"
###
###   # Etape 6 (admin audit)
###   $audit = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri "http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/audit?action=LOGIN_SUCCESS&limit=10" `
###     -Headers @{"Authorization"="Bearer $token"}
###   $audit.items | Format-Table createdAt, sourceService, action, correlationId
### =====================================================================
